From 2b0c87e622c55df5bfb064704d78b29d14467dae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:38:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add application priority, role family, skill-gap, and market
 intelligence to command center

Phase 2/5/9/10: application_priority, recommendation_for (APPLY NOW/APPLY/WATCH/SKIP), application_readiness (capped <=94), application_effort (banded, not inverted), and competition_signal persisted into scoring pipeline and Job model.

Phase 6/7/8: role-family taxonomy (7 families incl DATA_AUTOMATION) with hidden-fit detection, and skill-gap matrix (MATCHED/PARTIAL/MISSING, must-have vs nice-to-have).

Phase 4: freshness buckets updated to HOT/FRESH/RECENT/AGING/OLD/STALE; OLD added.

Backend: employer-radar, market-skills, search-health, why-hidden endpoints; /api/jobs gains min_priority/recommendation/min_readiness filters and sort_by=priority. Frontend cards + modal show recommendation badge, readiness, effort, role family, hidden-fit pill, competition, and skill matrix.

Phase 13: scrapers drop PhD/clearance/citizenship/defense-gated new-grad roles unwinnable for F-1/OPT candidates.

Tests: coverage for priority/readiness/effort/role-family/skill-gaps/hidden-fit; full suite 166 tests under plain unittest. Added AGENTS.md.

Co-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
